ure after selecting the Korean rating; an engineer requests the error state and time for MULTI-3198 and says the wider cause is unconfirmed.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873295.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U019\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U005\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873295.000226\", \"role\": \"ENGINEER\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d2\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"Two tutors in one thread report disabled Submit controls despite completing every field.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U004\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d3\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"A QA tutor reports that the Spanish evaluation on MULTI-2163 returns to the rating screen; a tutor in that thread reports no submission confirmation after selecting B.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922163.000171\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922208.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U008\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922163.000171\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U012\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922208.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d4\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"In the Korean-rating and disabled-Submit threads, the team lead requested task IDs, required-field states, and exact button behavior; the Korean-rating thread also needs the step after rating selection, and the provided replies do not supply those details.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873337.000339\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894249.000339\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873245.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873295.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894210.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922163.000171\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922208.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922265.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873337.000339\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894249.000339\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d5\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"For the tutor unable to finalize a review despite a saved rating, the team lead instructed the tutor to retain the task reference, flag the failure, and not count completion without confirmation.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934465.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U017\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934465.000113\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d6\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The announcements and earlier records retrieved for this run do not establish an existing submission-failure response, workaround, or outcome.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790862733.000190:8a8518aa\", \"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790861853.000153:923cb61d\", \"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790865625.000189:bba3ba5a\", \"k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\", \"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790907041.000188:b45804b2\", \"k:multi-korean-referral@1.0:929d7cee\", \"k:multi-audit-filename-convention-approval@1.0:a5a80940\", \"k:multi-japanese-review-pending@1.0:124c6b92\", \"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action\", \"kind\": \"ACTION\", \"text\": \"Report a technical issue to engineering. Instruction: Report these LT submission problems to engineering, grouping the symptoms and including available task references and the outstanding diagnostic requests. Draft to copy: Please investigate these LT submission reports:\\n- Two tutors report disabled Submit controls despite completing every field.\\n- A QA tutor reports failure after selecting the Korean rating (MULTI-3198).\\n- A QA tutor reports returning to the rating screen on the Spanish evaluation (MULTI-2163); a tutor in that thread reports no confirmation after selecting B.\\n- A tutor reports being unable to finalize despite a saved rating.\\nFor MULTI-3198, please collect the error state and time requested by an engineer. In the Korean-rating and disabled-Submit threads, please collect the task ID, required-field state, and exact button behavior I requested; the Korean-rating thread also needs the step after rating selection. Please check completion status: a saved rating is not proof of submission. Scope: The referral concerns reported submission symptoms; it does not assert a shared cause or confirmed submission outcomes.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922163.000171\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922208.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873295.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873337.000339\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894249.000339\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:ea925467\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873245.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894210.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922265.000226\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c1\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c2\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, 