, \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922265.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_a0e8e21fd079b3167031c525\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_a0e8e21fd079b3167031c525 is RESOLVED_IN_THREAD: The team lead answers the tutor's handling question with task-specific instructions to retain the reference, flag the failure, and not count completion without confirmation. This resolves the handling question, not the technical failure; the upstream review flag remains open.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934465.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity HIGH: Two QA tutors and four tutors report problems submitting or confirming completion of multilingual reviews. Several explicitly describe being unable to submit or finalize work.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922163.000171\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922208.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873295.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873245.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790922265.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894210.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:signal:HIGH[0]\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_SIGNAL\", \"text\": \"Rubric signal met - \\\"Explicit statement that assigned work cannot be completed or evaluated\\\": A QA tutor reports that LT will not submit a language review; two tutors report disabled Submit controls after completing every field; a tutor reports being unable to finalize a review.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790873198.000169\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894107.000172\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790894157.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790934407.000170\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:signal:HIGH[3]\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_SIGNAL\", \"text\": \"Rubric signal met - \\\"Multiple distinct people or affected tasks r